{"seq":1,"slug":"investment-controversies","title":"投资争议","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/investment-controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"missing-the-tech-wave","title":"错过科技浪潮","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/investment-controversies/missing-the-tech-wave","wordCount":1767,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"derivatives-and-criticism","title":"衍生品与批评","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/controversies-and-appraisal/investment-controversies/derivatives-and-criticism","wordCount":1819,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"投资争议\">投资争议</h1><p>巴菲特虽享盛誉，其投资生涯也并非全无争议。本章直面其中两个常被讨论的话题。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;错过科技浪潮&quot;——他长期回避科技股的争议，及其坚守能力圈的取舍。第二篇文档讲述&quot;衍生品与批评&quot;,考察他对衍生品的态度、个别投资的质疑与方法适应性之争。</p>\n"}